  "html": "<p><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/BB4.jpg\" title=\"Image:BB4.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:BB4.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"306\" src=\"/images/BB4.jpg\" width=\"731\"/></a><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th><i>Dungeon Levels</i>\n</th><th><b>Layout</b>\n</th><th><i>Mobs</i>\n</th><th><i>Mobs</i>\n</th><th><i>Attack to Use</i>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Balzack's Burrow L 1-4</b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_Layout\" title=\"Ruins Layout\">Ruins</a>\n</td><td>Ice Mutants\n</td><td>Divine Oroks\n</td><td><b>Divine, Ice</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--The Frigid Bean</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Cave_Layout\" title=\"Ice Cave Layout\">Ice Cave</a>\n</td><td>Poison Demonspawn\n</td><td>Ice Fades\n</td><td><b>Ice, Poison</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Cryptacular</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt</a>\n</td><td>Poison Demonspawn\n</td><td>Ice Fades\n</td><td><b>Ice, Poison</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--The Frozen Bean</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Cave_Layout\" title=\"Ice Cave Layout\">Ice Cave</a>\n</td><td>Poison Demonspawn\n</td><td>Ice Fades\n</td><td><b>Ice, Poison</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Balzack's Burrow L 5-7</b>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Catacombs_Layout\" title=\"Catacombs Layout\">Catacombs</a>\n</td><td>Poison Demonspawn\n</td><td>Ice Fades\n</td><td><b>Ice, Poison</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Nether Crypts</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt</a>\n</td><td>Shadow Oroks\n</td><td>Poison Mutants\n</td><td><b>Poison, Shadow</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--Crypts R Us</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt</a>\n</td><td>Shadow Oroks\n</td><td>Poison Mutants\n</td><td><b>Poison, Shadow</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><b>--The Cold Cave</b></i>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Cave_Layout\" title=\"Ice Cave Layout\">Ice Cave</a>\n</td><td>Poison Demonspawn\n</td><td>Divine Oroks, Ice Mutants\n</td><td><b>Ice, Divine</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b> ** Balzack's Flame</b>\n</td><td>Special\n</td><td>Poison Demonspawn\n</td><td>Ice, Shadow, Fire Demonspawn\n</td><td><b>Multiple</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Balzack's Burrow is recommended for characters from Level 55 to 100.  It is the tenth dungeon in the normal sequence, following <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>. It is accessible through <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow_Base_Camp\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow Base Camp\">Balzack's Burrow Base Camp</a>.  It can be a very difficult dungeon due to the mixture of elementals found on the various levels.</b>\n</p>\n<a name=\"DUNGEON_DETAILS\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>DUNGEON DETAILS</b></span></h1>\n<a name=\"Level_1\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 1</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_Layout\" title=\"Ruins Layout\">Ruins Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Melee_Wasp\" title=\"Frosty Melee Wasp\">Frosty Melee Wasp</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Ranged_Cannonier\" title=\"Frosty Ranged Cannonier\">Frosty Ranged Cannonier</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Runt\" title=\"Divine Runt\">Divine Runt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Taskmaster\" title=\"Divine Taskmaster\">Divine  Taskmaster</a>.\n</p><p>This is an easy dungeon to run solo for a mage with ranged and AoE attacks, but can be frustrating for a solo fightrer, because it contains large groups of fairly weak mobs.\n</p><p>There is a side dungeon called Frigid Bean.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Frigid_Bean\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Frigid Bean</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Cave_Layout\" title=\"Ice Cave Layout\">Ice Cave Layout</a>.  This is a very cold place and may cause <a href=\"/wiki/Shrinkage\" title=\"Shrinkage\">Shrinkage</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Haunt\" title=\"Toxic Haunt\">Toxic Haunt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poisonous_Felknight\" title=\"Poisonous Felknight\">Poisonous Felknight</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frigid_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Frigid Fade Soldier\">Frigid Fade Soldier</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Devastator!\" title=\"Frosty Devastator!\">Frosty Devastator!</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_2\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 2</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_Layout\" title=\"Ruins Layout\">Ruins Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Melee_Wasp\" title=\"Frosty Melee Wasp\">Frosty Melee Wasp</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Ranged_Cannonier\" title=\"Frosty Ranged Cannonier\">Frosty Ranged Cannonier</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Runt\" title=\"Divine Runt\">Divine Runt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Taskmaster\" title=\"Divine Taskmaster\">Divine  Taskmaster</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_3\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 3</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_Layout\" title=\"Ruins Layout\">Ruins Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Melee_Wasp\" title=\"Frosty Melee Wasp\">Frosty Melee Wasp</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Ranged_Cannonier\" title=\"Frosty Ranged Cannonier\">Frosty Ranged Cannonier</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frostbitten_Conscript\" title=\"Frostbitten Conscript\">Frostbitten Conscript</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Runt\" title=\"Divine Runt\">Divine Runt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Taskmaster\" title=\"Divine Taskmaster\">Divine  Taskmaster</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Hunter\" title=\"Divine Hunter\">Divine Hunter</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Chieftain\" title=\"Orok Chieftain\">Orok Clan Divine Chieftain</a>.\n</p><p>A side dungeon called Cryptacular.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Cryptacular\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Cryptacular</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt Layout</a> (Surprise!).  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Poisonous_Felknight\" title=\"Poisonous Felknight\">Poisonous Felknight</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Haunt\" title=\"Toxic Haunt\">Toxic Haunt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Devastator!\" title=\"Frosty Devastator!\">Frosty Devastator!</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frigid_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Frigid Fade Soldier\">Frigid Fade Soldier</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Baby_the_Line_Dancer\" title=\"Baby the Line Dancer\">Baby the Line Dancer</a> can be found right at the entrance.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_4\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 4</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ruins_Layout\" title=\"Ruins Layout\">Ruins Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Melee_Wasp\" title=\"Frosty Melee Wasp\">Frosty Melee Wasp</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Ranged_Cannonier\" title=\"Frosty Ranged Cannonier\">Frosty Ranged Cannonier</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frostbitten_Conscript\" title=\"Frostbitten Conscript\">Frostbitten Conscript</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Runt\" title=\"Divine Runt\">Divine Runt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Taskmaster\" title=\"Divine Taskmaster\">Divine  Taskmaster</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Hunter\" title=\"Divine Hunter\">Divine Hunter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whomper\" title=\"Whomper\">Frosty Melee Spitter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Chieftain\" title=\"Orok Chieftain\">Orok Clan Divine Chieftain</a>.\n</p><p>A side dungeon called The Frozen Bean.\n</p>\n<a name=\"The_Frozen_Bean\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">The Frozen Bean</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Cave_Layout\" title=\"Ice Cave Layout\">Ice Cave Layout</a>.  This is a very cold place and may cause <a href=\"/wiki/Shrinkage\" title=\"Shrinkage\">Shrinkage</a>. Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Haunt\" title=\"Toxic Haunt\">Toxic Haunt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poisonous_Felknight\" title=\"Poisonous Felknight\">Poisonous Felknight</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frigid_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Frigid Fade Soldier\">Frigid Fade Soldier</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Devastator!\" title=\"Frosty Devastator!\">Frosty Devastator!</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_5\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 5</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Catacombs_Layout\" title=\"Catacombs Layout\">Catacombs Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Raythe\" title=\"Toxic Raythe\">Toxic Raythe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fetid_Angel\" title=\"Fetid Angel\">Fetid Angel</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frigid_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Frigid Fade Soldier\">Frigid Fade Soldier</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Devastator!\" title=\"Frosty Devastator!\">Frosty Devastator!</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frigid_Dread_Mantis\" title=\"Frigid Dread Mantis\">Frigid Dread Mantis</a>.\n</p><p>A side dungeon called Nether Crypts.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Nether_Crypts\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Nether Crypts</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt Layout</a> (surprise!).  Contains Shadow <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Taskmaster\" title=\"Orok Taskmaster\">Orok Taskmaster</a>, Shadow <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Cave_Hunter\" title=\"Orok Cave Hunter\">Orok Cave Hunter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Whomper\" title=\"Whomper\">Mutant Melee Spitter</a>, Shadow <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Chieftain\" title=\"Orok Chieftain\">Orok Cave Chieftain</a>, Poison <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Ranged_Wasp\" title=\"Mutant Ranged Wasp\">Mutant Ranged Wasp</a>, and Poison <a href=\"/wiki/Deviant_Hurler\" title=\"Deviant Hurler\">Deviant Hurler</a>\n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> <i>Like all side-dungeons of Balzack's Burrow, this dungeon is ideal for farming, because of the huge groups of mobs. See comments in the <a href=\"/wiki/Farming\" title=\"Farming\">Farming</a> article.</i>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_6\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 6</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Catacombs_Layout\" title=\"Catacombs Layout\">Catacombs Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Arctic_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Arctic Fade Lichlord\">Arctic Fade Lichlord</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frigid_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Frigid Fade Soldier\">Frigid Fade Soldier</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Devastator!\" title=\"Frosty Devastator!\">Frosty Devastator!</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Oracle\" title=\"Toxic Oracle\">Toxic Oracle</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Mangler\" title=\"Toxic Mangler\">Toxic Mangler</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Raythe\" title=\"Toxic Raythe\">Toxic Raythe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fetid_Angel\" title=\"Fetid Angel\">Fetid Angel</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_7\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 7</span></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Catacombs_Layout\" title=\"Catacombs Layout\">Catacombs Layout</a>.  Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Arctic_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Arctic Fade Lichlord\">Arctic Fade Lichlord</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frigid_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Frigid Fade Soldier\">Frigid Fade Soldier</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frosty_Devastator!\" title=\"Frosty Devastator!\">Frosty Devastator!</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Oracle\" title=\"Toxic Oracle\">Toxic Oracle</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Mangler\" title=\"Toxic Mangler\">Toxic Mangler</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Raythe\" title=\"Toxic Raythe\">Toxic Raythe</a>.\n</p><p>Two side dungeons called Crypts R Us and The Cold Cave.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Crypts_R_Us\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Crypts R Us</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Crypt_Layout\" title=\"Crypt Layout\">Crypt Layout</a>.  Contains Shadow <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Taskmaster\" title=\"Orok Taskmaster\">Orok Taskmaster</a>, Shadow <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Cave_Hunter\" title=\"Orok Cave Hunter\">Orok Cave Hunter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Cave_Shaman\" title=\"Cave Shaman\">Cave Shaman</a>, Poison <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Ranged_Wasp\" title=\"Mutant Ranged Wasp\">Mutant Ranged Wasp</a>, and Poison <a href=\"/wiki/Deviant_Hurler\" title=\"Deviant Hurler\">Deviant Hurler</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"The_Cold_Cave\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">The Cold Cave</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Cave_Layout\" title=\"Ice Cave Layout\">Ice Cave Layout</a>.  This is a very cold place and may cause <a href=\"/wiki/Shrinkage\" title=\"Shrinkage\">Shrinkage</a>. Contains <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Ranged_Wasp\" title=\"Mutant Ranged Wasp\">Mutant Ranged Wasp</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Deviant_Hurler\" title=\"Deviant Hurler\">Deviant Hurler</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Cave_Hunter\" title=\"Orok Cave Hunter\">Orok Cave Hunter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Taskmaster\" title=\"Orok Taskmaster\">Orok Taskmaster</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Toxic_Mangler\" title=\"Toxic Mangler\">Toxic Mangler</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Conscript\" title=\"Noxious Conscript\">Noxious Conscript</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Balzack.27s_Flame\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Balzack's Flame</span></h1>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Balzack.jpg\" title=\"Balzack\"><img alt=\"Balzack\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"269\" src=\"/images/Balzack.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Balzack.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Balzack</div></div></div>\n<p>There is a barrier blocking the way to <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack\" title=\"Balzack\">Balzack</a>.  There are four side rooms, each containing a <a href=\"/wiki/Sarcophagus\" title=\"Sarcophagus\">Sepulcher</a> which releases a horde of <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Champions_and_Heroes\" title=\"Category:Champions and Heroes\">Champions and Heroes</a> of many different types.  It also opens a portal which releases more monsters until it is destroyed. All four groups must be defeated to release the barrier.  Balzack appears as a giant Poison Winged Demon Snake, surrounded by many more Poisonous Champions and Heroes, and opens a Poison Portal which releases more continually.\n</p><p>For tips on fighting Balzack, see <a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Guide\" title=\"Boss Guide\">Boss Guide</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
